{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MangaCo</strong>\u00a0\u2013 The Ultimate Creative Companion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn Every Input Into Artistic Progress!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the most responsive desktop idler! <strong>MangaCo</strong> transforms <strong>any input device</strong> into creative energy \u2013 whether you're typing a document, sketching on your tablet, playing music, or just browsing the web, your actions power your manga artist's productivity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go full turbo-mode or relax and let automation handle slow periods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2615 Cozy Progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw manga in various genres earning <strong>money</strong>, <strong>achievements</strong> and\u00a0growing your <strong>collection</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your way to make a great\u00a0piece or just use a bit of <strong>luck</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet oddly specific requirements to find the <strong>secrets</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa8 Character &amp; Environment Customization</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine\u00a0<strong>mangaka styles</strong> from shonen action to cozy slice-of-life aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorate</strong> your workspace with different themed items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>trophies</strong> for different <strong>achievements</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude80 Always-On Productivity</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Always visible</strong> above other windows</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjustable window size</strong> to match your workflow</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customizable position</strong> on your screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance optimized</strong> to run smoothly alongside other apps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Universal Input Support</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouse</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Controller</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Drawing Tablet</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MIDI Devices</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now and Transform Your Computer Time Into Creative Energy!</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Catch 'Em All!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931290/0facd8e700e7204d5bc5303878be93f136807167.jpg"},{"name":"Interior designer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931290/41719076afc0501a4cfabd92ca85eb56d904cb9e.jpg"},{"name":"My dress up darling","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931290/b9df58407063e0579e900ed71811cdc7eba1486d.jpg"},{"name":"Cheer up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931290/dfc65af2092e04e61859de1bb50752fbc46a76f5.jpg"},{"name":"A.F.K.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931290/37a4c65fd0a4b6feb61ca2a2ee086806d1987dd6.jpg"},{"name":"Deadliner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931290/7d148551d91b73d999ab9e2b6ba863ca034ad301.jpg"},{"name":"Good seller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3931290/ce00b48e59bf6f5331c643a728457c0234a2847a.jpg"},{"name":"Newbee seller","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/